        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_92">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="10" y="60" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="60" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>뽑기는 ｢캐릭터 모델 뽑기｣와 ｢사운드트랙 뽑기｣의 2가지가 있습니다. 뽑기를 하려면 토큰이 필요합니다.</text>
            <topColor r="100" g="50" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="100" g="50" b="0" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_92" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_94">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="300" y="120" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.6666679" y="20" />
            <text>｢Collection｣에서는 뽑기를 통해 얻은 3D 캐릭터 모델이나 사운드트랙을 감상할 수 있습니다.</text>
            <topColor r="100" g="50" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="100" g="50" b="0" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_94">
              <texMap imageName="18_01" imageNameLeft="" imageNameRight="" stereoEnabled="false" />
            </material>
            <texEnabled>true</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>RightTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>10</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>6</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>9</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>10</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_95">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="36" y="9" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="216" y="22" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="18.3333378" y="22" />
            <text>뽑기</text>
            <topColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_95" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_97">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="34" y="0" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="207" y="22" />
          <textBox font="cbf_ko-Hang-KR" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="18.3333378" y="22" />
            <text>토큰을 획득하기</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="125" b="225" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="0" g="125" b="225" a="255" />
